  "operational": [
   "Candidate crossing: centroid 5-40 m ahead of the ego and within 31 degrees of its heading (stereo field of view 62.6 degrees) at some pose; window = all such poses.",
   "Stationary vehicle: vehicle-category annotation boxes (REGULAR_VEHICLE, LARGE_VEHICLE, BUS, BOX_TRUCK, TRUCK, TRUCK_CAB, VEHICULAR_TRAILER, SCHOOL_BUS, ARTICULATED_BUS, MESSAGE_BOARD_TRAILER, RAILED_VEHICLE) whose city centres stay within 0.6 m of a seed box for at least 30 distinct sweeps (about 3 s), greedy grouping in time order.",
   "Near the crossing: cluster centre within 12 m of the crossing polygon, and its time span overlaps the crossing view window.",
   "Reference pose: the pose in the view window whose crossing-centroid forward distance is closest to 20 m.",
   "At the reference pose the vehicle is forward > 2 m and within 31 degrees (in stereo view), 0 < forward < crossing forward + 2 m (between ego and crossing), and lateral < -1.5 m (right side).",
   "A site with at least one such vehicle is a Blocked-test candidate; only left-side such vehicles (lateral > +1.5 m) makes a left-side case; none makes a control."
  ],
